# Route: guide 33 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 51 to 53, 50
# quests, 4.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale, Badlands, Burning Steppes, Swamp of Sorrows,
# Redridge Mountains, Searing Gorge, Loch Modan, Blasted Lands, Tirisfal
# Glades): Booty Bay -> Mistvale Valley -> Nek'mani Wellspring -> Booty Bay ->
# Wild Shore -> Jaguero Isle -> Booty Bay -> Kargath -> Camp Cagg -> Kargath
# -> Camp Cagg -> Ruins of Thaurissan -> Blackrock Stronghold -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Monogrammed Sash (8552;
# Mok'rash 50); Facing Negolash (618; Negolash 52); Facing Negolash (8554;
# Negolash 52); Message in a Bottle (630; King Mukla 51); Broken Alliances
# (793; Blacklash 50, Hematus 50); Necklace Recovery (2283; Shadowforge
# Surveyor 35-36, Shadowforge Ruffian 36-37, Shadowforge Digger 35-36,
# Stonevault Rockchewer 36-37, Stonevault Oracle 37-38, Stonevault Cave Hunter
# 36-37).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Find the Gems and Power Source (2339), Disharmony of Fire
# (3907), Commander Gor'shak (3981), The Rise of the Machines (4063), KILL ON
# SIGHT: Dark Iron Dwarves (4081), KILL ON SIGHT: High Ranking Dark Iron
# Officials (4082), Operation: Death to Angerforge (4132), Lost Thunderbrew
# Recipe (4134), Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), The Pack Mistress (4724), Kibler's
# Exotic Pets (4729), The Darkstone Tablet (4768), En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862),
