# Taste of Flame (4024), Precarious Predicament (4121), The Heart of the
# Mountain (4123), Egg Freezing (4734), Egg Collection (4735), Blackhand's
# Command (7761), The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8966), The Left
# Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8967), The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's
# Amulet (8968), The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8969), The Right
